<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Jan forex reserves hit $19.830 bln.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Jan forex reserves hit $19.830 bln.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's foreign exchange reserves rose to $19.830 billion in January from $19.125 billion in December, a government official said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>&quot;Our reserves in January reached $19.830 billion,&quot; the government official told Reuters.</p>
<p>Indonesia had foreign exchange reserves of $14.789 billion in January 1996.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +621 384 6364</p>
